[B][SIZE=4]Comparing against the original[/SIZE][/B]

Original-Java comparisons cover packets, scripts, animation, audio and rendering. Below: one synthetic 100 × 100 raster case. All 128 cases matched, within this bounded test.

[I]Original-Java reference test — Original Java: controlled terrain/model order, case 1.[/I]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/main/images/client-parity/29-java-reference.png[/IMG]

[I]Rust differential test — Rust: the same case, identical RGB pixels.[/I]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/main/images/client-parity/30-rust-comparison.png[/IMG]

Latest validated checkpoint: 1,111 tests passed, one legacy test ignored; native acceptance completed 819 frames with three server-confirmed actions and zero audio errors.

[B][SIZE=4]Still in development[/SIZE][/B]

Broader rendering and occlusion, session recovery, gameplay coverage and sustained stability remain active work. Feedback is welcome as client parity continues.

[SIZE=2]Credits: Project Gielinor / RS Mod, RSProt, RuneLite and RSProx contributors. Development primarily with GPT Astra under human direction and review. RuneScape and the depicted game assets belong to Jagex; this is an unofficial, unaffiliated project.[/SIZE]
